        "answer": {
          "short": "$144$ students",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Bike angle}&=360^\\circ-90^\\circ-120^\\circ-50^\\circ\\\\&=100^\\circ\\\\\\text{Total students}&=40\\div\\frac{100}{360}\\\\&=144\\end{align*}$$",
